## TIẾNG ANH · 16:30–17:00 — Thứ Hai: Daily Standup

### 16:30–16:40 · Shadowing

2 phút podcast. Nghe → dừng → nhại to.

### 16:40–16:55 · Standup có ghi âm

> *"Morning. Last week I finished the auth flow — SecureStore for sessions, protected routes, and I dug into how refresh token queuing works.*
> *This week is all about testing, which is honestly the area I've been weakest in. Today I set up Jest and covered the stats logic and the Zod schemas. I also wrote down an explicit list of what I do and don't test, because I think knowing what to skip matters as much as knowing what to cover.*
> *Tomorrow I'll move on to component tests with React Native Testing Library.*
> *No blockers."*

**Cụm *"honestly the area I've been weakest in"* rất đáng dùng.** Thừa nhận điểm yếu kèm bằng chứng đang khắc phục nghe mạnh hơn nhiều so với giả vờ giỏi mọi thứ.

### 16:55–17:00 · 5 từ mới

| Từ / cụm | Nghĩa | Câu mẫu |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `cover` (v) | phủ test | *I covered the stats logic.* |
| `edge case` (n) | trường hợp biên | *I test the edge cases first.* |
| `brittle` (adj) | dễ vỡ (test hay hỏng vặt) | *Snapshot tests are brittle.* |
| `implementation detail` | chi tiết triển khai | *Don't test implementation details.* |
| `skip` (v) | bỏ qua có chủ đích | *Knowing what to skip matters.* |

